iffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan C. Stein","x":"At the end of 2019, we completed our nomination process with Hess and updated our tariff rates for 2020 and all forward years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/hess-midstream-partners-lp-hesm-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"HESM 2019 Q4","e":"hesm","d":"2020-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan C. Stein","x":"Tariffs increased in 2020, primarily from recovering reduced revenues from lower volumes and generating incremental revenues on higher capex during 2019, as a result of the delay in LM4, which we had proactively integrated into our contract structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/hess-midstream-partners-lp-hesm-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"HESM 2019 Q4","e":"hesm","d":"2020-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan C. Stein","x":"Total operating expenses including G&A but excluding depreciation and amortization, pass-through and transaction costs, were higher, decreasing adjusted EBITDA by approximately $6 million, including higher seasonal maintenance activity during the period of approximately $3 million and higher…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/hess-midstream-partners-lp-hesm-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"HESM 2020 Q1","e":"hesm","d":"2020-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan C. Stein","x":"In the current environment, where throughput volumes are expected to be lower than Hess's development plan at the end of 2019, our tariff rate was adjust higher as part of the annual rate redetermination to maintain our return on capital.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/hess-midstream-partners-lp-hesm-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"HESM 2020 Q1","e":"hesm","d":"2020-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan C. Stein","x":"…attributable to the following: Our total revenues increased by 15% quarter-on-quarter, including reve